{"content":[{"c":["ZEPHANIAH (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Priest during the reign of Zedekiah who was executed at Riblah by the king of Babylon (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.25.18","r":"2Kgs.25.18","rawR":"2Kgs.25.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.25.18","value":"2Kgs.25.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 25:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.52.24","r":"Jer.52.24","rawR":"Jer.52.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.52.24","value":"Jer.52.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 52:24"},"). He was the second priest under Seraiah the chief priest and served as Zedekiah’s envoy to Jeremiah during the period prior to the fall of Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.21.1","r":"Jer.21.1","rawR":"Jer.21.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.21.1","value":"Jer.21.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 21:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.29.25-29","r":"Jer.29.25-29","rawR":"Jer.29.25-29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.29.25-29","value":"Jer.29.25-29"}],"t":"ref","v":"29:25-29"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.37.3","r":"Jer.37.3","rawR":"Jer.37.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.37.3","value":"Jer.37.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"37:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Ancestor of Heman who was among the Kohathite Levites whom David placed in charge of the service of music in the house of the Lord (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.33-36","r":"1Chr.6.33-36","rawR":"1Chr.6.33-36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.33-36","value":"1Chr.6.33-36"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:33-36"},"). Zephaniah is listed as the father of Azariah and the son of Tahath."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Author of the book of Zephaniah (",{"href":"?bref=Zeph.1.1","r":"Zeph.1.1","rawR":"Zeph.1.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zeph.1.1","value":"Zeph.1.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zep 1:1"},"). Though little is known about Zephaniah, it is possible that his ancestor Hezekiah is the same as the king by that name. ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ZephaniahBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ZephaniahBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ZephaniahBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Zephaniah, Book of"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Father of Josiah in whose house Joshua was crowned as high priest (",{"href":"?bref=Zech.6.10-14","r":"Zech.6.10-14","rawR":"Zech.6.10-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zech.6.10-14","value":"Zech.6.10-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zec 6:10-14"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ZephaniahPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 25:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.25.18","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.25.18","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.25.18"},{"anchorText":"Jer 52:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.52.24","rawQueryValue":"Jer.52.24","sourceRefExact":"Jer.52.24"},{"anchorText":"Jer 21:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.21.1","rawQueryValue":"Jer.21.1","sourceRefExact":"Jer.21.1"},{"anchorText":"29:25-29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.29.25-29","rawQueryValue":"Jer.29.25-29","sourceRefExact":"Jer.29.25-29"},{"anchorText":"37:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.37.3","rawQueryValue":"Jer.37.3","sourceRefExact":"Jer.37.3"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:33-36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.33-36","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.33-36","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.33-36"},{"anchorText":"Zep 1:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zeph.1.1","rawQueryValue":"Zeph.1.1","sourceRefExact":"Zeph.1.1"},{"anchorText":"Zec 6:10-14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zech.6.10-14","rawQueryValue":"Zech.6.10-14","sourceRefExact":"Zech.6.10-14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"241e1d998aaaea7049fdf5c9960568c1ea5dfc2f79ec4fd1289525e4cbea8f76","sourceItemName":"ZephaniahPerson","sourceItemOrder":75,"sourceMember":"Articles/Z.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"ZephaniahPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Zephaniah (Person)","title":"Zephaniah (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}